e enemy to move and attack.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/disgaea-2-dark-hero-days", "videos": [{"id": 37722, "name": "Game Intro", "video_id": "qn4qqguYpQA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qn4qqguYpQA", "title": "[HD] [PSP] Disgaea 2: Dark Hero Days - Opening", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/qn4qqguYpQA/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 46837, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "pqFqyQDWyQ8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pqFqyQDWyQ8", "title": "Disgaea\u00ae 2: Dark Hero Days Main English Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/pqFqyQDWyQ8/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 46838, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "N3OpCJjWtfs", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=N3OpCJjWtfs", "title": "Disgaea 2: Dark Hero Days ... (PSP) Gameplay", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/N3OpCJjWtfs/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 987, "name": "Disgaea"}]}